{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_10_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:acd9bdebd0b67d2ca39a3ffe0b4d38a41f02323688a0578b452d159916f2f27a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000031:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7493bb7dfe0c9fadf11a9efd1868cb67fbdafb566db805ee611eb24b374bcb3b",
      "text": "JIF开演",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:217083b35d256d1d333420eadb81de8e78cd949798017a4fb9991ad8c335d1f3",
      "text": "（……大屏幕上打出了315 Pro的名字）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2251b1ba9c7721b627886cdf1e6288a202c00d28ecab090a63c9959542251fc0",
      "text": "（……但是观众的反应一般。\n嘛，到目前为止都跟预想的一样）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e845a86e394d0d9958ae60a9532a054db679f987a72710ae017c4cdfbe8728c",
      "text": "315 Pro，是那个“投票名额”进来的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b6e15b51dd6f27997fc205493d3c43c4cb838631f64f0bc6a1a0a2297213883",
      "text": "对。后来追加确定出演的那家。\n我不太了解他们就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:279390b1ce40eb6c596a6120c2b8602a35a7dbe2fdb46370a6cede6cacc427f2",
      "text": "315 Pro——！加油啊——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4035612157b42d79cd84fde0da98777bbb2c88b90ef1c1a0422dcc9fd0f2c45",
      "text": "（……为了支持我们到今天的粉丝，\n我也要让这场演出成功！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c09fdb53976f76d2f499f51b03848cf4dd145286036264fde4a1f457d5376265",
      "text": "……呐，两位。\n虽然马上就要开始了，但要不要来那个？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:447518caf4840bd594405badaa5b790ad7d2efdf280a2a150eeec7b6d0d1290f",
      "text": "啊……嗯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0bf08dad94bf917832cd5fe850ff4348e7de62891a4b37bee13ad229ed6fffc",
      "text": "从走出商店街，到来到这里，\n总觉得就是一眨眼的工夫呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8249de7d1e6eadc0a34b63663fa1bc4c70b41c017b39b08c6fc2d4575467cce",
      "text": "嗯……但是，重要的东西，一直都没有改变。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4676f2f0ad3a023859c4ff131deec6168c55a2382b56e399c6eea34ba33d084f",
      "text": "我最喜欢实、恭二了。\n想和你们两个，一直保持笑容！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000164:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d08d2aecf80dc6126eb642c728c815b5f3ddc7c920b1a5731a739832325093c",
      "text": "皮埃尔……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000173:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85597d2d5c377c1ae193eee67a0211a5450e895a8fa305cd0e46bafce57de809",
      "text": "三个人一起，实现梦想。今后也要，一直奔跑下去！\n所以，Beit……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000183:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1242ade2fa4bf44e84766c05074ba7e05e94c3c08d6f18cc34ec4b3a1b75de7b",
      "text": "嘿——嘿——，哦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_f:cmd-000211:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da7badde18021ae4d92ab6305ee167c8c7b2d922a205863c5bf8bd871d8b5ac1",
      "text": "……上吧，315 Production！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
